       "html": "<p><strong>Address:</strong> Mocean Beach Resort, Pantai Moro, West Sumbawa (Sumbawa Barat), Nusa Tenggara Barat, Indonesia</p><p>About 30 minutes by car from Poto Tano ferry port and around 2 hours 15 minutes from Sumbawa Besar airport (SWQ). We arrange pickups from both. <a href=\"/travel-lombok-sumbawa/\">See transfer details</a>.</p>"
